        "original_id": "fadb7240-adb0-5013-80f2-12322575c94e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Peston, Allegra Stratton, Sophy Ridge\n- Programs: Peston on Sunday, Sophy Ridge on Sunday\n- Organizations: ITV News\n- Roles: Political Editor\n- Events: late-2000s financial crisis, Northern Rock crisis\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Peston became known to a wider public through his reporting on the late-2000s financial crisis, especially his scoop on the Northern Rock crisis.\n- Peston on Sunday is presented by Robert Peston, who is the Political Editor of ITV News, and the programme features discussion with politicians and public figures on the major news events of the week.\n- Since May 2016, Allegra Stratton has co-presented Peston on Sunday with Robert Peston.\n- Sophy Ridge on Sunday follows a similar format to Peston on Sunday and is broadcast at the same time as Peston on Sunday.",
